\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LPzJNgka0_UQ7kNvwE7LT8x&_nc_oc=Adkh0jhVVxWRUXWvOyNpI-DWSDKXNdbL28lZTuqtm9_ZZKn0GS1yD9dZXyUHxEikYp0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyEY4MLgND5NbaAUDwXzkKRAEeZtvJ5u9eTM0QhPq8kNw&oe=69B15074"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=U1AnCGn_wOsQ7kNvwEEldpK&_nc_oc=Adn7Ns54e5WK1VPtCq6Vpm68CfEyT8_-rf5k5VPrUv90hF-bSTgyuRK9vlf4mLnPx5A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyeMrMl9jHxO7u80lPaQlQHjY3x8DVqjZtkjDlBYrfNVw&oe=69B151D6"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7N2FdbbMHl8Q7kNvwHL4O4p&_nc_oc=AdnZGNXQzu6r0XCVa9e2it3Zc4dQmXeu6cq2chrO4uUyqx7PETwltYsKgVLPYtnXnzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyB_RkA2U9Gkku3dI7qk1VyQPfTD18YzeCVCkgptb3TSw&oe=69B166F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771